#
# Build and measurement artefacts. Read them, put the summary in the Results
# section of docs/spikes/G3prime-segment-budget.md, and let them be deleted
# (spikes/README.md, "Build outputs are git-ignored"). The raw 9_600-line hash
# stream of one run is not something to commit; the digest it reduces to is.
#
# Cargo.lock is NOT ignored: `--locked` is what makes the three-OS hash-stream
# comparison in ci/spike-g3.yml a controlled experiment rather than three
# unrelated builds.

target/
out/
results/
